{"parse": {"title": "十全调·【度朔飞琼】", "pageid": 132309, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"十全调·【度朔飞琼】\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b9/Item-140111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"十全调·【度朔飞琼】\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>十全调·【度朔飞琼】</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#140111</div></div><hr /><div>各行其是的、拾全拾美的线，可在【度朔飞琼】征集中使纺车转动十周。<br /><span style=\"color:#AC5320\">仅限用于【度朔飞琼】中征集角色。【度朔飞琼】限时征集结束后，&lt;color=#AC5320&gt;该道具过期。</span></div><div style=\"color:#696969\">兔子们总是如此，古怪、忙碌、难以猜测。如今，它们有了新乐趣，比偷走时间更甚。是的，金兔子的传闻仍在延续，这便是最新的一页。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "十全调·【度朔飞琼】"}}